    "source": "All pins come from the read-only ATM10 8.1 reference instance at E:/curseforge/Instances/All the Mods 10 - ATM10. SHA-1 matched its CurseForge metadata; licenses, dependency ranges and sides were read from each JAR. No reference-pack configuration, keybinding file, script, quest or asset is included.",
